Turret 10009 is the level-2 ice cannon. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 1.192 m. The crystal stays on `TurretHead`. Height is 6.34 m and the base's long side is 4.35 m, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10009.md`.

