Turret 10011 is the level-2 machine gun. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 1.760 m. Both barrels stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 3.91 m and the base is 4.35 m across, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10011.md`.

Turret 10012 is the level-3 machine gun. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 1.335 m. All three barrels stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 3.96 m and the base is 4.35 m across, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10012.md`.

Turret 10013 is the level-3 ice cannon. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 0.929 m. The launcher and the crystals stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 7.90 m and the base's long side is 4.35 m, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10013.md`.

Turret 10014 is the level-1 electromagnetic cannon. Its yaw pivot is the neck gap at 0.714 m. The gun and the cables stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 3.92 m and the base's long side is 4.35 m, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10014.md`.

Turret 10015 is the level-2 electromagnetic cannon. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 1.208 m. The gun and the side coils stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 3.35 m and the base's long side is 4.35 m, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10015.md`.

Turret 10016 is the level-3 electromagnetic cannon. Its yaw pivot is the neck ring at 1.444 m. The gun and the side coils stay on `TurretHead`. Height is 3.70 m and the base's long side is 4.35 m, the same footprint as 10010. The record is `docs/turret-10016.md`.

Planted body scale is 0.7 on level 1 (10005, 10008, 10010, 10014), 1 on level 2 (10006, 10009, 10011, 10015), and 1.3 on level 3 (10007, 10012, 10013, 10016). `TurretPlacer` applies it when the prefab loads. The heights above are the unscaled models. 10000, 10001, 10002, and 10004 have no level and stay at scale 1.

Turret fire animations use the clip name `Fire`. When importing or splitting an FBX take, set the animation split name to `Fire` and keep the existing clip id so prefabs stay linked. Do not leave the default `Take 001` name.
